{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"thread\": \"一个人渐渐喜欢上了陪伴自己的人，却始终担心自己的感情会成为对方的负担，或让对方觉得太黏。于是他反复想坦白又收住，经历安心、欢喜、患得患失，最后终于不再隐藏喜欢，也不再执着于得到永远不变的保证。\",\n  \"sections\": [\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S01\",\n      \"caught\": \"心动却怕添负担\",\n      \"echo\": \"\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S02\",\n      \"caught\": \"亲近安心又舍不得\",\n      \"echo\": \"S01\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S03\",\n      \"caught\": \"想说喜欢却没说\",\n      \"echo\": \"S01\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S04\",\n      \"caught\": \"反复想说仍收住\",\n      \"echo\": \"S03\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S05\",\n      \"caught\": \"心意露出后慌了\",\n      \"echo\": \"S04\",\n      \"why\": \"勉强\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S06\",\n      \"caught\": \"对方没变才安心\",\n      \"echo\": \"S05\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S07\",\n      \"caught\": \"盼对方也需要陪伴\",\n      \"echo\": \"S06\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S08\",\n      \"caught\": \"想坦然回应又怕无常\",\n      \"echo\": \"S07\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S09\",\n      \"caught\": \"怕他不再需要陪伴\",\n      \"echo\": \"S07\",\n      \"why\": \"勉强\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S10\",\n      \"caught\": \"暂且不猜以后\",\n      \"echo\": \"S09\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S11\",\n      \"caught\": \"愿陪伴也不强求\",\n      \"echo\": \"S09\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S12\",\n      \"caught\": \"不再藏起喜欢\",\n      \"echo\": \"S11\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S13\",\n      \"caught\": \"幸福难保又想退缩\",\n      \"echo\": \"S12\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S14\",\n      \"caught\": \"不求永远仍坦白\",\n      \"echo\": \"S13\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"overall\": \"最吃力的是 S06—S09，情绪在安心、孤独、渴望和害怕失去之间来回转变，有些散词也比较抽象，不容易马上拼出完整意思。最抓人的是 S01—S05 反复想说喜欢却不敢说，以及 S14 终于坦白、不再强求永远的前后呼应，能明显感受到人物的变化。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "52037a80-f449-4979-b299-64fb6f509d18", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261105T185532109441Z", "elapsed_seconds": 52.187, "completed_utc": "2026-11-05T18:56:24.305133+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "43fdbe9dd38d7fd3e0c49612eca1a46e05884826db32ffa3f43dcfbc06178e1b", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261105T185532109441Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "1d2af0ce7fc514f0a00a95b12f61f49d4807ad63feb03800b1cbbfbe6af0ff34"}}}
